<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 20px; }
      .container { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
      h1 { color: #232f3e; border-bottom: 2px solid #35171-60-124; padding-bottom: 10px; }
      .badge { background: #e7f3ff; color: #007bff; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8em; font-weight: bold; }
      .link-section { margin-top: 30px; background: #f9f9f9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; }
      ul { list-style-type: none; padding: 0; }
      li { margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
      a { color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      .status { color: #28a745; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1><%= title %> <span class="badge">v2.0 (Automated)</span></h1>
      
      <p>This application is part of the <strong>DevOps CA Project</strong>. It is currently running in a Docker container on an AWS EC2 instance, deployed via a fully automated CI/CD pipeline.</p>

      <h3>Project Menu</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>☕ Coffee</li>
        <li>🍵 Tea</li>
        <li>💧 Water</li>
        <li>🚀 <strong>Status:</strong> <span class="status">Live & Secure (HTTPS)</span></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="link-section">
        <h3>Deployment Architecture Links</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>GitHub Repository:</strong> 
            <a href="https://github.com/YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME/YOUR_REPO_NAME" target="_blank">View Source Code</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Docker Hub Image:</strong> 
            <a href="https://hub.docker.com/r/eskandaratrak/devops_ca" target="_blank">View Docker Registry</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Infrastructure:</strong> 
            <a href="http://35.171.60.124" target="_blank">AWS EC2 (Elastic IP: 35.171.60.124)</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Pipeline:</strong> 
            <a href="https://circleci.com/" target="_blank">CircleCI Build Status</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>